# Project: IT Lifecycle & Service Management Platform

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- Language: TypeScript (Strict mode)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI
- Database & ORM: PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM
- State Engine: State machine pattern for Request Lifecycle
- Automation Bridge: Webhooks to n8n

## Architectural Guidelines
1. Do not invent new API endpoints or database fields without updating `prisma/schema.prisma` first.
2. Every lifecycle change (Onboarding/Offboarding/Access) MUST write an entry to `AuditLog`.
3. Separate IT Admin actions from HR/User actions using Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
4. Do not hardcode external API calls inside core routes; emit webhooks for n8n orchestration.
